---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | GoZeroShot"
  description="Terms of Service for GoZeroShot's social-media distribution, publishing, analytics, and marketing-automation tools."
>
  <main class="main legal-page">
    <section class="legal-shell">
      <a class="back-link" href="/">Back to home</a>
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="effective-date">Last updated: September 21, 2026</p>

      <p>
        GoZeroShot provides a social-media distribution, publishing,
        analytics, and marketing-automation tool/service. It may connect to
        authorized accounts on platforms such as Pinterest, TikTok, X,
        LinkedIn, Meta/Facebook/Instagram, YouTube, Bluesky, Buffer, Medium,
        Hashnode, Google Ads, Mixpanel, and Google Analytics (GA4), to create
        drafts, schedule or publish content, read account-owned content and
        performance data, retrieve analytics, and support sandbox or
        non-delivering advertising workflows.
      </p>

      <h2>Authorized use</h2>
      <p>
        You may use GoZeroShot only in compliance with applicable law, each
        connected platform's own terms and policies, and these Terms. You are
        responsible for the accounts you connect, the content you submit, and
        any instructions you give the tool.
      </p>

      <h2>Your account and connected platforms</h2>
      <p>
        You are responsible for maintaining the security of your account and
        any platform accounts you connect. You must have the rights necessary
        to authorize GoZeroShot to act on a connected account, and you remain
        responsible for actions GoZeroShot takes under the authorization you
        grant. Do not share account credentials, tokens, or authorization
        codes with anyone, and GoZeroShot will never ask you to submit them
        through chat or a public form.
      </p>

      <h2>Content ownership and rights</h2>
      <p>
        You retain ownership of the content, data, and materials you submit.
        By using GoZeroShot, you confirm you hold the rights necessary to
        publish that content and grant GoZeroShot permission to process,
        store, and transmit it only as needed to operate the requested
        drafting, scheduling, publishing, or analytics workflow.
      </p>

      <h2>Platform-rule compliance</h2>
      <p>
        Every connected platform remains governed by its own terms and
        policies, independent of these Terms. You are responsible for
        complying with each platform's rules, including its content,
        automation, and advertising policies. GoZeroShot is not endorsed,
        certified, or approved by any connected platform.
      </p>

      <h2>Prohibited use</h2>
      <p>
        You may not use GoZeroShot for spam, deceptive automation, platform
        policy evasion, or any activity that violates a connected platform's
        terms, applicable law, or the rights of others.
      </p>

      <h2>Availability</h2>
      <p>
        The service is provided on an &quot;as is&quot; and &quot;as available&quot; basis.
        We do not promise uninterrupted publishing, permanent availability of
        any connected platform's API, or that any specific integration will
        remain supported. We may update, suspend, or discontinue features at
        any time.
      </p>

      <h2>Disclaimers</h2>
      <p>
        GoZeroShot makes no warranties, express or implied, regarding the
        service, including warranties of merchantability, fitness for a
        particular purpose, or non-infringement. Publishing, scheduling, and
        analytics results depend in part on third-party platforms outside our
        control.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the fullest extent permitted by law, GoZeroShot is not liable for
        any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive
        damages, or for any loss of data, revenue, profits, or business
        opportunities arising from your use of the service.
      </p>

      <h2>Termination</h2>
      <p>
        We may suspend or terminate access to the service if you violate
        these Terms, misuse the service, or create risk for us, other users,
        or a connected platform.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these Terms from time to time. Continued use of the
        service after updates take effect means you accept the revised
        Terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these Terms can be sent to
        <a href="mailto:alynch@gozeroshot.dev">alynch@gozeroshot.dev</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    display: block;
  }

  .legal-shell {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: #4a6f98;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  h2 {
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  p {
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
  }

  .effective-date {
    color: #6b7280;
  }
</style>
